(text "UPS RESERVE: actual charging, cell protection, power path, NTC and current limits must be designed after chip selection." (at 25 792 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid 0a4272f1-05f8-558a-b623-0e429ccce0a8))
(text "Battery ADC: GPIO2 ADC1_CH1, enable GPIO9; 150k/100k + 100nF; Vbat = 2.5 x calibrated ADC volts. Protected 1S 4.2V assumed." (at 25 801 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid 1fe23814-c849-5ff4-bdda-45b80dfcd9bf))
(text "No firmware changes: optional radar RX GPIO6 / reserved TX GPIO8; button GPIO0; modem PWRKEY GPIO11 / RESET GPIO21 proposed only." (at 25 810 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid 6a6fe948-04dc-5439-a5c2-6723da360919))
(text "USB: SERVICE R26/R27/R30 OR HOST R28/R29/R31 + J22, never both. J22 = GND/DP20/DM19. J13 pins28/29 NC. Hardware USB test pending." (at 25 819 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid 8fd8447c-d566-5c28-acc3-8d1686ea7bcf))
(text "J19 VBAT: one shunt only 1-2 internal buck OR 2-3 external regulated 3.8V at J20; none isolates modem. Never 5V at J20." (at 25 828 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid 7f4c7396-2310-5694-a24d-831b72681f9e))
(text "INPUT: nominal 5V/2A, 4.5-5.5V range. F1/Q6 protection; JP4 selects direct or future UPS; parallel 3.8V/5V rails." (at 25 837 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid e54b9f30-8f3e-54e5-b092-bd2a2b46fbb1))
(text "JP1 one shunt: 1-2 BOARD_REG_5V / SYS_5V OR 2-3 SYS_5V / BENCH_REG_5V. Both sources regulated 5V." (at 25 846 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid 7c5f2010-33a4-5ee9-bfd0-591ec4b5ce0c))
